  "Günde 1-2 sulama periyodu ile toplam 200-300 ml/bitki EC 1.6 besin çözeltisi verilir.": "Give a total of 200-300 ml/plant of EC 1.6 nutrient solution in 1-2 irrigation periods a day.",
